    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 275,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community meeting about the library garden. I'm Mark, the volunteer coordinator. We have a problem: the garden is full of weeds, and the library wants to use it for a reading event next month. So, we need a plan. Any ideas?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ec5879052e6ded3d12d77d55d45425719b9cd95b4dd0cb34d2528a86e0053619",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 279,
        "sourceEnd": 471,
        "text": "Yes, I'm Lisa. I think we should organize a weekend clean-up. If we get enough volunteers, we can clear the weeds in one day. But we need tools. Does anyone have gardening tools we can borrow?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "abea35b194187561872c1402abcd321da22f4d97a794047b497045c3a6553ea7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 475,
        "sourceEnd": 693,
        "text": "Good point, Lisa. I can ask the local hardware store. They might donate some tools. But we also need to think about the plants. If we pull out all the weeds, the garden will look empty. Maybe we can plant some flowers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ffaf040a071b92f88ba9a34b9e2389dc209e6ea7a67fc28830b23512708660cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 697,
        "sourceEnd": 951,
        "text": "That's a good idea. I'm Sarah, by the way. I'm a teacher at the primary school. My students could help plant flowers. They love gardening. If we ask them, they will probably say yes. But we need to do it on a weekend because they have school on weekdays.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "368dc89792a3ebb056b594c0c85279cfe0ce0c3003945140f3178ce856a37b55",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 955,
        "sourceEnd": 1085,
        "text": "Great, Sarah. So, we have two tasks: weeding and planting. We also need to water the plants regularly. Who can help with watering?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8189c24e63e71189c730a391952d713534282d3b87e879a88b899e2a61197c88",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1089,
        "sourceEnd": 1306,
        "text": "I'm Tom. I live near the library. I can water the plants every morning before work. But I work early, so I can only do it before 8 a.m. If we install a simple watering system, it would be easier. But that costs money.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0ebb4b96e95b16b5e10d8866f3f85262db221de1d210d59f2df6b15dce8e6c55",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1310,
        "sourceEnd": 1522,
        "text": "Right. Money is a challenge. We have a small budget from the library, but not much. Maybe we can ask for donations from local businesses. If we explain the project, they might help. But we shouldn't rely on that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5f502b50dbcd3f615bd2c56371a276d9585dfe4ee1b61fd7656f274f78ac0ea6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1526,
        "sourceEnd": 1753,
        "text": "I'm Anna. I have another idea. We could ask the city council for a small grant. They often support community projects. If we write a good proposal, we might get some money. But the deadline is next week, so we need to act fast.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e2d5f11543fe7ca08006c7af04286d5371b07c3661aa0a40046aacf9b36430ca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1757,
        "sourceEnd": 2063,
        "text": "OK, Anna. That's a possibility. Let's summarize. We need volunteers for weeding and planting, tools, and money for a watering system or plants. Lisa will contact the hardware store. Sarah will talk to her students. Tom will water the plants. Anna will look into the grant. I will coordinate. Any questions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "de47e221558761d98718330cf3c8a240fb41ef8bfc45591a387dae9b93546ff0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 2067,
        "sourceEnd": 2113,
        "text": "Yes, when is the clean-up day? We need a date.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3eb21e021cfbecfec14d35bc594302796afa4db137f968d450084df88ef870e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 2117,
        "sourceEnd": 2274,
        "text": "Good question. Let's aim for the first Saturday of next month. If the weather is bad, we will move it to the following Saturday. Does that work for everyone?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "70d1212cd18d7e2afd7ec6e19f71da673459ea52b03dfb01618a17a0906c17b6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 2278,
        "sourceEnd": 2312,
        "text": "Sounds good. I'll spread the word.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e52b4c24c83eac7c4eb5342bf3f486810213fda217ce3103e42238b6cdb6d1c9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 2316,
        "sourceEnd": 2386,
        "text": "Great. Thank you all. Let's meet again next week to finalize the plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8e3d23ca7565902c328a182f7cab544fc1376acbe74eae119861c2407e6dbdc5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
